window.products.push({"id":438078,"name":"Bialetti Impact, Non-Stick 2 Quart Sauce Pan, Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":40.25,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61t2PTMrPgS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Transport a taste of Italy to your home kitchen with the Bialetti Impact Textured Nonstick 11\" Stir Fry Pan. Inspired by Italian style and design, this nonstick frying pan features a large 11\" diameter surface and deeper size that is ideal for a variety of cooking applications, from stir frying vegetables, chicken, and steak to simmering sauces. The Impact cookware collection is made with textured heavy-gauge aluminum that is achieved by blasting the interior of the cookware with metal pellets during the manufacturing process. This Micro-divot textured surface provides professional results by eliminating hotspots and evenly distributing oil so the entire interior of the pan can be covered for better searing. This sauté pan features a Nanotec-infused nonstick coating to offer excellent release, and it is also metal utensil safe so you can cook and serve meals all in one pan. The riveted silicone handle offers a comfortable and secure grip during cooking. This versatile wok-style pan can be used on both gas and electric stovetops and is oven safe up to 400 degrees Fahrenheit so you can sauté, sear, simmer, roast, bake, and more with ease. To care for your Bialetti cookware, hand washing is recommended.Bialetti began in Italy, but has become a leading brand around the world because our high-quality products bring simplicity, functionality and beauty to the kitchen. Our advanced technology and distinctive styling combine to create cookware that’s simple to use and simply beautiful. Today, the Bialetti family of products has grown. We bring a multitude of styles and colors to market. But our Italian heritage and passion for cooking live on in every line.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61t2PTMrPgS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bialetti","source_asin":"B0BG9BWQL7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-438078","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BG9BWQL7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BG9BWQL7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":438079,"name":"4 Pack Magnetic Curtain Tiebacks, Convenient Decorative Drape Rope Curtain Tie Backs Holdback Holder for Window Draperies (Gray)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+9jzHV15S._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"UPGRADE STRONG MAGNET: Magnetic curtain tie backs use the strong and durable magnet with nickel, plating which is smooth and rust-resistant will not separate easily, easy use and store without damaging your walls, perfect for protecting your draperies, just clip on the curtain when you don't use them, decorative and easy to find. adding a modern beauty to your windows. NEW DESIGN: Beautiful and elegant magnetic curtain tiebacks with classic European style, Perfect fitting in all different styled scene, attractive curtain accessories make your life more easy and comfortable. EASY TO USE: No drilling no tools required, super easy to operate, hold your curtain in seconds. You can use different binding methods according to your preferences to make your curtains achieve the best beauty. It is a perfect substitute for wall mounted hooks and could be tied on anywhere. WIDELY APPLICATION: Magnetic curtain tiebacks can be used as window curtains tiebacks for draperies, sheers, shower curtains. Tie backs without attaching to the walls, no hooks required. Simple design ideal for your sitting room, living room, bathroom, bedroom, nursery, bed-curtain net holder, balcony curtain, drapes, sheers, patio, window treatment hardware, and outdoor uses. SIZE: Total length approx 18 inch include magnetic ball, ball diameter 1inch. It could be twisted, The length and binding method can be adjusted freely according to the thickness of the curtain. You can adjust as per your requirements, no worry about the length, clip your curtain in different elegant ways.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+9jzHV15S._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Geritte","source_asin":"B0BT9TP1FC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-438079","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BT9TP1FC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BT9TP1FC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
