window.products.push({"id":438092,"name":"CODOGOY Candle Warmer Lamp with Timer, No Flame Electric Candle Wax Melting Lamp, Dimmable Candle Lamp, Compatible with Small & Large Candle for Home ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":43.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WQHhQOAXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🦩【Aromatherapy Lamp】-- The theory of the candle lamp is using the bulb to heat and accelerate the uniform heating and melting of the candle surface. It uses heat to melt the candle from top to bottom, releasing a steady and continuous scent that lasts twice as long as it burns. Soft halogen lights create the ambiance of burning candles, while the scent of your favorite candles sets the mood. 🦩【Dimmable + Timer】-- Our candle wax warmer lamp features an adjustable temperature and brightness that caters to different fragrance concentrations, wax longevity and room brightness requirement. Our timer switch offers 10 levels of timer adjustment. 🦩【Safe & Environmental】-- Our candle warming lamp respects the concept of environmental protection, does not light candles to reduce carbon monoxide emissions, avoids the situation that the memory circle and the bottom of the candle can not be burned out. No flame, no smoke, no soot, safe and no pollution. Good Bye Fire Forever! 🦩【Multiple Uses】-- This candle lamp warmer with timer can create a warm and romantic environment, suitable for many occasions. For example, dates, meals, holidays, outdoor activities, camping, bars, birthdays, parties, etc. Equipped with a non-slip mat accommodates different sizes and shapes of candles. 🦩【Best Valentine's Day Gift】-- No one can say no to this The wax warmer for scented wax gift, a fragrance that combines practicality and fancy, with a high-end fragrance that is pleasing to the body and mind. Can be used as Valentine's Day, Thanksgiving, Christmas, Memorial Day gift.（Candles are NOT included）.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WQHhQOAXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CODOGOY","source_asin":"B0BMXC2TDM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-438092","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMXC2TDM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMXC2TDM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
