window.products.push({"id":438188,"name":"Elrene Home Fashions Kaiden Geometric Room-Darkening Window Curtain, Single Panel, 52\" W x 84\" L (1 Panel), Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.92,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ckZyivmFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Elrene Home Fashions provides beautifully fashionable home decor to suit any decorating taste. Capture that trendy style with our Kaiden Geometric Room-Darkening Window Curtain for your bedroom, living room, or office. Easy to hang, this panel has elegant and sturdy sewn-in 1.65-inch brushed-silver grommets and will fit up to a 1-inch-diameter curtain rod. This single panel has a lovely and delicate geometric design that comes in a variety of colors to add understated elegance to windows throughout your home.Increase the beauty and classic style of any room while also reducing light. With beautiful simplicity, this single panel combines practicality and looks. The room-darkening technology pairs with fashion to present a curtain panel that can block the sun, keep furniture from fading, and help with temperature control. Made from a durable poly-linen blend, this curtain hangs beautifully, has a wonderful texture, is sturdy, and will stand up to daily use and sun exposure. It also has enough weight and thickness to give a lifetime of stylish good looks. Simple care means that a machine wash is all that is needed to keep this drape looking amazing. This curtain is a worthy investment for your home and is available in 2 sizes: 52\" W x 84\" L and 52\" W x 95\" L.Established in 1922, Elrene Home Fashions was founded on the principles of quality and guaranteed satisfaction. With the help of our expert artists and designers, we produce high-quality, fashionable home decor for every home and decorating palate. We are 100% committed to our customers and strive to give the very best in all of our products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ckZyivmFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elrene Home Fashions","source_asin":"B07VLJ1XWX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-438188","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VLJ1XWX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VLJ1XWX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
