window.products.push({"id":438357,"name":"Modern Elegance - Halloween Decorations Insulated Wine Tumbler - 12oz Steel Straw with Cleaning Brush - Halloween Cups - Halloween Mug, Pumpkin, Witch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.85,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51whGKTw4jL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"Fun Halloween Wine Tumbler – Cute and spooky designs this 12 oz stainless steel wine tumbler adds a fun look to your next Halloween party and comes in tons of great designs including pumpkins, ghosts, witches brew, spider cider, and more Retains Hot and Cold Drink Temperatures – Designed with double wall vacuum insulation this stemless wine tumbler supports hot and cold beverages and keeps them tasting fresh and delicious when you’re enjoying indoor or outdoor parties. BPA-Free Plastic Spill Proof Drink Lid – The perfect reusable party glass our funny mugs also come with a sliding lid with small drink spout to keep your cocktails or Halloween brews from spilling out when you’re dancing and partying the night away. Heavy-Duty, Unbreakable Stainless Steel – Our high-quality Halloween mug is made with 18/8 food grade stainless steel which is rust resistant, super durable, and can be used for picnics, camping trips, boating, backyard BBQs, and pool and beach days. Essential Accessories Included – Every Modern Elegance Halloween tumbler also comes with a reusable drink straw with cleaning brush, so you can keep your drink cup fresh and clean when it’s time for mimosas, red wine, shots, and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51whGKTw4jL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Modern Elegance","source_asin":"B08GFF599H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-438357","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GFF599H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GFF599H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
