window.products.push({"id":438419,"name":"TeiKis 10 Piece Boston Cocktail Shaker Bartending Set Complete Bar Accessories Set with Mat Included","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91RphpwlC2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Easy to use This Easy-to-use two-piece shaker makes mixing perfect cocktails foolproof. With its stainless steel shaker, mixing glass, 1 oz and 1.5 oz double jigger, 4 Prong Hawthorn Strainer, muddler, bar spoon with masher, spill mat, and 3 spouts/pourers this set includes everything you need to make high quality drinks. Package Includes 1 30oz Boston Cocktail Shaker, 1 Mixing Glass, 1 4-Prong Hawthorne Strainer, 1 Bar Spoon with Masher (28.5cm), 1 Muddler, 1 double jigger (1oz and 1.5oz), 1 Bar Spill Mat, 3 Spouts / Pourers Just like a Professional bartender Our Boston Shaker is the same shaker preferred by professional bartenders. Consisting of a pint-sized glass tumbler topped by a stainless-steel shaker and all the necessary accessories needed. These tools provide the basics, whether you are a novice or a pro, for making perfect drinks at your next party. About TEIKIS TEIKIS is a growing brand of quality products designed to enrich your home life. From big parties, small cook out, to just keeping your home organized while having a little fun we have you covered. TEIKIS took their passion and created products that make everyday life a bit easier. Dedication and time is spent on ensuring the highest quality products are created before being placed on the market. Manufacturing products that fit the TEIKIS standards is a must, and will never be taken lightly. Warranty A two year manufacturer warranty and satisfaction guarantee are placed on all TEIKIS products. If for any reason, you are not completely satisfied with your TEIKIS products, you can avail 100% Money Back Guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91RphpwlC2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TeiKis","source_asin":"B01BV8E1E0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-438419","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01BV8E1E0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01BV8E1E0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":438420,"name":"ZENY 8-in-1 3.7 Quart Programmable Electric Air Fryer, 1500W LCD Display Screen Control Kitchen Cooker w/ 8 Cooking Settings, Auto Shut off & Timer (W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61l7vos3F9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SPECIFICATIONS: Dimensions: 13”(L) x 10”(W) x 13“(H); Weight: 11.05 lbs.; Mesh Basket Demension: 7.5\" x 7.5\" x 3.5\"; Fryer Pan Demension: 8\" x 8\" x 4.6\"; Mesh Basket Capacity: 3.7 Quart (3.5L); Fryer Pan Capacity: 4.4 Quart (4.2L); Material: Plastic, Specialty; Volts: 110-120V, 60Hz; Timer: 0-30min; Temperature Range: 176 to 392 degree; Power Indicator: Yes; Heating Indicator: Yes; Detachable Basket: Yes; Color: Black/White/Red No assembly required Package Contents: 1 x 1500W Electric Air Fryer 1 x Manual 1 x Recipe Book *Bonus*l","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61l7vos3F9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZENY","source_asin":"B077MYTV6N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-438420","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077MYTV6N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077MYTV6N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":438421,"name":"Scott Living Solid Sateen 500 Thread Count 4-Piece Performance Bedding Sheet Sets and Pillowcase | Full | Crown Blue | Designer Home Luxury Sheets | B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FWZzP4MdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"After renovating houses for hundreds of families, hosts of HGTV’s “Property Brothers” Drew and Jonathan Scott know how to make a home work for everyone – and that includes high-quality home furnishings, textiles and décor that look great and fit your needs. Scott Living by Drew & Jonathan reflects their commitment to help you create the perfect space for the people you love. With the Scott Brothers’ latest collection featuring modern and nature-inspired patterns, you’re sure to make a statement. A DESIGNER LOOK TO LOVE in a luxury 40% recycled polyester, 35% cotton, and 25% TENCEL Lyocell sheet set. A 500 thread-count sateen crafted in an inviting tri-blended fabric featuring TENCEL Lyocell for unmatched softness, cotton for breathability, and polyester for long-lasting durability. Available in a range of solid colors from classic staples to modern exciting hues to pair with any existing bedroom or decor. Perfect for everyday use, master, kids bedroom, dorm room or guest bedrooms. MUST HAVE FEATURES Our modern soft sheets are constructed for everyday performance. Both flat sheet & pillowcase feature a 4\" cuff with single pleat for a tailored look. Decorative stitch and silk like smoothness for luxury. Fitted sheet includes an elastic band for a snug fit and fits a mattress up to 16” deep. Cover up with the right amount of warmth and breathability for a blissful sleep. Full Set Includes 1 flat sheet (81”x96”) 1 fitted sheet (54”x76”x16\") 2 standard pillowcases (20”x30”). CAREFULLY DESIGNED, Scott Living bedding is better for you, your family, and the planet. Our cotton blended sheet set is environmentally friendly as cotton fibers are naturally biodegradable unlike microfiber that is difficult to break down. Our products are also made using environmentally sustainable farming practices and water saving technologies. We care about the environment and guarantee our manufacturing is leading the way to a better tomorrow. EASY CARE, Machine wash warm with like colors, gentle cycle. Only non-chlorine bleach when needed. Tumble dry low, remove promptly. Warm iron when needed. We stand by our product and offer a 30-DAY \"LOVE-IT\" GUARANTEE, \"We're not happy unless you're happy\". We recommend for an added polished look, pair or gift with the Charles Faux Fur Blanket and Willow Cotton Sateen Comforter or Duvet Set by Scott Living to add luxury to any bedroom. Each sold separately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FWZzP4MdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Scott Living","source_asin":"B09NDP91D6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-438421","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NDP91D6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NDP91D6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
