window.products.push({"id":438481,"name":"Panasonic NC-HU301P Water Boiler 3.2-Quart with Vacuum Insulated Panel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GKY4q6hpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Panasonic NC-HU301P 3.2 Quart Thermal Hot Pot has a Vacuum Insulated Panel (VIP) which keeps the hot water hot, just like a thermos. Save up to 42% energy compared to models w/o this protection.3 Temperature Settings (180/190/208 degrees F) that is ideal to use for noodles, tea, coffee, baby food and more. The \"Binchotan-carbon\" on the inner surface of the pot is coated with Diamond Fluorine. By making the boiling time longer, it alkalizes the ph. level of hot water which enables you to extract more \"tasty\" elements of tea such as amino acid and catechin. You can enjoy healthier tea that reduces body fat and a decline in cholesterol. 4-speed Dispenser control, automatically controls how the water is dispense. Cordless Electric Pump allows the unit to stay hot (approx. 90 degrees) up to 3 hours after the AC cord is unplugged which makes the unit very portable. Other features include: 360 degree Rotating body, Over Heating protection, Easy-to-read Red Floating Water Level Indicator, 98/90/80 degree Keep Warm Selection, De-Chlorination Mode, Low-water warning, Safety Locking Lid and Dispenser, Timer Mode, Removable Lid, Quick Disconnect Power Cord, Multi-Lingual Instruction Manual, 120AC/60Hz. Dimensions: 8 9/16\" (W) x 11 5/16\" (D) x 10 13/16\" (H), 4.4 lbs. White.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GKY4q6hpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Panasonic","source_asin":"B001SE32GG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-438481","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001SE32GG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001SE32GG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":438482,"name":"Atelier Home Linen Duvet Cover - 100% Soft Cooling Cotton Bedding - Comforter Protector Sheet with Hidden Zipper, Corner Ties - 500 Thread Count Anti-","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91CsLguVthL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Do your bedding help you sleep better? Your bed must be a peaceful retreat that leaves you feeling calm and relaxed so that sleep comes easy. Not only should it be neat and tidy, but it also has to look and feel comfortable and inviting for rest. You tried making it work. With your interior designer hat on, you've gone through all the bedding shelves in big box stores. Alas, all you could find are thin and scratchy duvet covers with noisy patterns. So you go home frustrated, thinking about another restless night under your old, uncomfortable, sweaty sheets. Turn your bed into a comfortable retreat with the Atelier Home Linen Duvet Cover Set! Designed with simplicity, each piece in this bundle is easy on the eyes. The neutral solid hues are patterned after elegant hotel bedding and will easily match any room theme or color motif. Your bedroom will immediately acquire a luxurious look and ambience once your pillows and blankets are laid down on your bed. Our duvet cover and pillowcases are created from long-staple combed cotton grown in tropical India. The fabric is sateen woven to give it shine and an airy feel that gets softer over time. It is also made durable and thick with a 500 thread count. All items are dyed with IMaster H20 to protect from shrinkage and fading, and to make the cloth hypoallergenic. Wash by hand or machine and avoid creases by hanging drying on the clothesline. If you prefer to tumble dry, spray a little water before ironing to remove the wrinkles. Here are more reasons why our duvet cover is your best sleeping partner: ✨ Set includes 1 duvet cover and 2 matching pillow cases ✨ Color Options: Dark Gray and Sky Blue ✨ Available Sizes: Twin, Queen, King Bring elegance to your bedroom and comfortable sleep to your bed. Add Atelier Home Linen Duvet Cover Set to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91CsLguVthL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Atelier Home Linen","source_asin":"B07CWNWCFL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-438482","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CWNWCFL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CWNWCFL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
