window.products.push({"id":438496,"name":"Lynnlov Pure Cotton Knit Blankets and Throws, Lightweight Soft Cozy Knitted Blanket, Solid Decorative Chic Throw Blankets for Couch/Bed/Sofa, Gift, Ho","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1QUFo9nt2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【100% Natural Cotton】 Organic cotton fabric make throw blankets naturally smooth and soft , which does not contain any synthetic compounds. It's breathable and great at regulating your body temperature, so 100% cotton blankets will keep you cozy without overheat. So the cotton knit blanket is a great choice for people with sensitive skin, and even suitable as baby blankets. Clean the knit blanket with FREE LAUNDRY BAY. 【Suitable for Multiple Scenarios】 The knit throw blankets measured by 50\"X60\"(130x150cm), 1.8lbs, have a multitude of uses, from using as couch decor throws, to cotton blanket for your bed, or even as a blanket to wrap around your shoulders when watching TV on the sofa. Cotton blankets and throws are ideal for adding a soft touch and vision to any room. 【Chic & Durable Crochet Blankets】 Classic crochet design adds chic decorative elements to your couch, bed, sofa, room, nap and reading corner. High-quality throw blankets are made of 100% cotton with a tight seed stitch and chic ribbed edge detailing that make the knit blanket more durable and solid, not easy to fall off. 【Oeko-Tex Certification】 Our knit throw blankets are made with natural cotton fabric in a premium factory that is OEKO-TEX certified. We source with these high standards to ensure the cotton blankets free of harmful chemicals making it safe to hold against your bare skin. Please rest assured to add to the shopping cart. 【Laundry Bag For Easier Care】 We provide a bonus laundry bag as a gift for each knit blanket! Clean the knit blanket by it during the machine wash to better care for your blanket to extend its service life and make it better to bring you comfort and companionship. Cotton blankets hold up well when repeatedly washed. No chlorine bleach. No fabric softener. Do not iron.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1QUFo9nt2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lynnlov","source_asin":"B09655L5TC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-438496","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09655L5TC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09655L5TC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":438497,"name":"Cole & Mason Stadhamptom Chili & Spice Mill - Spice Grinder for Chili, Cinnamon, Peppercorn, Cardamom & More - Add a Grinder for Spices and Seeds to K","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618wBSfq9pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"\"Having an easily accessible and incredibly attractive means of serving your favorite chili and spices has been made possible with the debut of the Cole & Mason Stadhampton Mill. Flavor is released by a two-step process that will see your preferred chili or spices shredded and then ground before being released. The addition of an adjustable setting allows for increased control over grind size and consistency when chili and spices are added to a dish. This mill features a removable mechanism that allows for a convenient and altogether effortless approach to cleaning the mill between uses. The Stadhampton Mill itself offers a timeless aesthetic with an acrylic body and double-sided stainless steel accents. Care Instructions: Hand wash/do not submerge Warranty: 10 year mechanism/2 year mill guarantee Materials: Stainless steel/acrylic Dimensions (W x H x L): 2.6 x 2.6 x 6.5 in. Weight: 0.63 lbs. Style, durability and dependability have been built into every Cole & Mason product since 1919. Using the best materials and mechanisms, our products have been praised by professional cooks and homemakers ever since. You can count on Cole & Mason to give your kitchen table salt and pepper grinder set a touch of class! Since the launch of our first mill, we have continued our expansion into a full range of seasoning products that include: specialty mills, spice racks and oil and vinegar pourers. Our continued drive to deliver excellent design and performance has resulted in the award of CoolBrands status for 2015, an annual initiative to identify and pay tribute to the UK's coolest brands, voted for by the public. Allow our passion for great seasoning and a range of products crafted with care and quality to enhance your cooking experience, supporting you on a journey to release the flavor in your food.\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618wBSfq9pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cole & Mason","source_asin":"B0B5L6K9Y5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-438497","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5L6K9Y5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5L6K9Y5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
