window.products.push({"id":438855,"name":"RAVLEY HOME California King 100% Egyptian Cotton 1000 Thread Count 6 Piece Bedding Set Extra Deep Pocket Upto 18\" Extra Long Staple Soft & Breathable ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MfJuchS-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wrap yourself in the softness of the luxurious 100% Long Staple Egyptian Cotton Sheets. One of the softest fabrics in the world on your bed to enjoy a perfect sleep. 1. LONG STAPLE EGYPTIAN COTTON&SATEEN WEAVE Our Sheet Sets are made by 100% Long Staple Egyptian Cotton. Sleep better andwake up each morning feeling refreshed and full of energy. Our unique sateen weave creates a fabric with an extremely soft touch and an elegant sheen while providing you the most luxurious pillow cases. 2. MADE IN GREEN by OEKO-TEX MADE IN GREEN by OEKO-TEX is a traceable consumer label for products made with materials tested for harmful substances, Breathable ,made in environmentally friendly facilities and made in safe and socially responsible work places. Each item with the MADE IN GREEN label features a unique product ID. Each product ID gives you visibility into the various stages of production as well as the countries in which the textiles were manufactured. 3. EASY CARE The Sheet Set are fade, stain and shrink resistant that make you can safely clean it. Machine wash in cold water with similar colors. Warm iron when necessary. Tumble dry low. Do not bleach. These beautiful pillowcases are skin friendly, hypoallergenic and made to last long. 4. SPECIFICATION Material: 100% Long Staple Egyptian Cotton Package List & Size: Queen, King, California King -1 Flat Sheet: 1 Fitted Sheet 4 Standard Pillowcases: 5. SATISFACTION GUARANTEE we are super confident in the quality and comfort of our product that we offer a 100% satisfaction guarantee! Try our products and you will love it.The collapse was a sobering reminder of neglectful, unsustainable, and unethical trade practices that are far too common in the textiles industry. Practices that many businesses turn a blind eye to and that customers aren’t privy to. It was from that point forward that RAVLEY HOME knew the world didn’t just need another bedding company, Making a product our customers love is our passion .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MfJuchS-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RAVLEY HOME","source_asin":"B07SC2QS7C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-438855","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SC2QS7C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SC2QS7C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
