window.products.push({"id":438889,"name":"Pearington 5-gal. Insulated Hot and Cold Beverage Server/Dispenser, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":149.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JptfLfNYL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep drinks at their most refreshing temperatures for up to 4 to 6 hours with the Pearington Insulated Beverage Dispenser. This versatile dispenser accommodates to a variety of hot drinks such as coffee, warm milk, tea, and hot chocolate or cold drinks such as juice, iced tea, or simply water. With a large capacity of 5 gallons, it's perfect for serving drinks at restaurants, hotels, parties and events, family gatherings, offices, schools, or even at home. This drink server features a double-wall shell, a set and secure inlaid sealing ring to provide additional heat retention, and is filled with commercial-grade polyurethane foam to achieve optimal insulation. Without any electricity or additional power necessary, liquids are kept safe and energy conservation is achieved. This durable dispenser is made with two layers of food-grade LLDPE material to withstand daily and long-term use. Ergonomically designed, its comfortable handles allow for easy carrying. It also contains a spring action faucet with O-ring seals that efficiently prevents leaks, allowing for simple and mess free transportation. No assembly is required, and cleaning is simple with a damp cloth. The Pearington Insulated Beverage Dispenser measures 16.6\" x 10.6\" x 25\" and weighs 16 pounds.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JptfLfNYL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pearington","source_asin":"B09NQLQ12V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-438889","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NQLQ12V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NQLQ12V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":438890,"name":"Art and Aura Table Runner for Dining Table | Abstract Design | Premium Fabric Dining Room Decor | Dresser Scarf | Wedding and Holiday | Multiple Sizes","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.37,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xVZ6-LJWS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Aura Abstract Inspired by abstract design, this runner was designed with the goal of bringing bold colors and exciting patterns to your dining table. Urban Modern If your goal is to create an urban modern setup in your home, this runner with abstract patterns would fit right in. Mid-Century Modern Key to achieving a mid-century modern design is to have at least one statement piece standing out with all other elements being neutral. This runner can be your statement piece. If you have an open concept living room, your dining table with this table runner will draw a lot of attention. Emotion Colors evoke an emotion in us. Warm colors are associated with vibrance, joy and playfulness, while cool colors make us feel relaxed. This runner has been carefully designed to create the right mood at your table. Break bread with joy Dining table is where you break bread with your guests. This runner has a higher mix of warm colors than cool colors and hence brings vibrance and joy when hosting dinner parties for your guests. Size Recommendation We recommend the 14x72 inches for tables that seats up to 4. Go with the 14x108 inches for 6 to 12 seater tables. Care Instructions Cold wash separately. Tumble dry on low. Low iron if needed. Variations Our artisans make it with hand, so please expect slight variations in stitches. But hey, that makes your product unique! Our Promise Art and Aura aims to bring happiness to your dinner table so your guests feel at home. We work with fine fabric makers and world-class designers to create fantastic table runners and we test it in at home before we sell them to you. We hope that you love your purchase. If not, let us know and we will go out of our way to make things right.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xVZ6-LJWS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Art + Aura","source_asin":"B0986MBJSV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-438890","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0986MBJSV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0986MBJSV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
