window.products.push({"id":438965,"name":"Rzoysia 0.6\" Thick No Suction Cups Non Slip Shower Mat, 16\"x27.5\", Two Colors Design Anti-Dirty Bathtub Mat, PVC Loofah Massage Foot Mat for Bathroom,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JEp3+zbML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"No Suction Cups: The suction cups bathtub mats usually accumulate dust and easy to move on the smooth surface. So we adopted no suction cups design. This bathtub mat without suction cups, which keeps the mat flat under feet. Provide more soft and comfortable touch. Loofah Mat: This shower mat is made high quality PVC, phthalate free. The textured mat is also a massage mat. When you use it take a stand up shower, the loofah surface of this mat can slightly massage your sole of feet. Help you relax quickly after a short shower time. Quick Drying: The shower mat is hollowed, so it drys quickly for hanging on any places. The hollow structure is also convenient for draining. The bath mat can be placed over the drainage while using. Water flows unimpeded, and hair would be caught. Tips: Machine wash is not recommended. Adjustable Size: This mat is different for the traditional vinyl bathtub mats. You can easily cut this mat in a shape you want. That means you can diy the mat suitable for your bathtubs, shower stalls and even just for the shape you like. Why So Thick? Our mat is 3/5 inch, it far beyond the thickness of other loofah mats. After long time testing, we find 3/5 inch is a suitable thickness for most people. It can reduce the hardness of the textured surface. So your feet will get more support and comfort in shower.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JEp3+zbML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rzoysia","source_asin":"B0BXL4WZ4X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-438965","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXL4WZ4X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXL4WZ4X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
