window.products.push({"id":438969,"name":"Now Designs 60 by 90-Inch Hemstitch Tablecloth, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-5KhxHnXL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product Description For over 45 years Now Designs has created fashionable, fun, and functional kitchen textiles, table linens, gifts and decorative accessories for the home. Whether it's kitchen basics, fashion forward designs or gifts for any season, Now Designs' quality and workmanship is unsurpassed. Now Design's Hemstitch tablecloths feature a smart, classic border and are available in a variety of colors to compliment any tabletop palette. Tablecloth measures 60 by 90-inch and is designed to fit tables measuring 36 by 66 to 48 by 78-inch. Made of 100-percent cotton and coordinates nicely with Hemstitch napkins and Basic Collection placemats. Machine washable, iron as needed; made in India. Amazon.com Now Designs Hemstitch and Micro Rib Collection Now Designs has been creating beautiful and functional kitchen textiles and table linens for over 40 years. We design high quality napkins, placemats, runners and tablecloths in a wide selection of colors and patterns. At Now Designs we take color seriously! We share a love and passion for color. Our mission is to bring color to your home. Hemstitch and Micro Rib For simple elegance, you can't beat the timeless look of 100% cotton Hemstitch table linens. Our collection features tablecloths, napkins and placemats in sixteen bright, beautiful colors. We invite you to mix, match and use your creativity and imagination to color your kitchen to reflect your style. Micro-rib Placemats Our Micro-rib placemats flaunt flawless construction in a very fine yet durable weave. Micro-rib colors match Hemstitch beautifully, so give these quality placemats some time in the spotlight. Placemat size is 13 x 19\" - 33 x 48cm. Hemstitch Napkins Classic Hemstitch Napkins are 100% cotton. Solid colors coordinate perfectly with our Hemstitch tablecloths. Napkin size is 20 x 20\" - 51 x 51cm. Tablecloths Whether you set the table in a classic or contemporary style our Hemstitch Tablecloths are essential for tabletop. Because they are 100% cotton minor shrinkage is to be expected after washing. Tablecloths are available in four sizes: Education without Borders A percentage of the profit on the sales of Now Designs product lines go to Education without Borders. The objective of the foundation is to foster educational opportunities and provide educational facilities in disadvantaged regions of the world.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-5KhxHnXL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Now Designs","source_asin":"B00GHKT2II","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-438969","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GHKT2II","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GHKT2II","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
